      - Main cross aisle near y=0: about 1.80 m.
      - Side aisles between rack rows: about 1.30 m.
      - Outer perimeter aisles: about 1.45 m or more.
      Suggested Nav2 footprint:
        [[0.25, 0.20], [0.25, -0.20], [-0.25, -0.20], [-0.25, 0.20]]
      Suggested inflation_radius: 0.30 to 0.40 m for safe simulation.
